{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36926","headline":"县斋秋晚酬友人朱瓒见寄 · 罗隐","name":"县斋秋晚酬友人朱瓒见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"中和节後捧琼瑰，坐读行吟数月来。\n只叹雕龙方擅价，不知赬尾竟空回。\n千枝白露陶潜柳，百尺黄金郭隗台。\n惆怅报君无玉案，水天东望一裴回。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36926.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36926","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}